type: software
title: "RNA-seq Explorer"
abstract: >-
  Interactive downstream analysis workstation for RNA-seq data.
  Processes DESeq2 differential expression and rMATS alternative
  splicing results with GSEA/ORA enrichment analysis,
  publication-quality visualization, and multi-format export.
